  {%- case f -%}
  {%- when 'intro' -%}Replacement parts for Aiper Scuba pool robots: chargers, a charging dock, debris baskets and filters, plus a caddy for the Scuba X1 Pro Max and Scuba N1 Max. Each part is named for the Scuba models it fits.
  {%- when 'h2' -%}Finding the right Aiper part
