Baskets and filters. Spare debris baskets for the Scuba N1 and N1 Pro, and ultra-fine filters for the Scuba L1.
Keep it charged. A spare charger or the Scuba N1 Pro charging dock.
  {%- when 'why' -%}Free shipping on most Aiper products, usually delivered in 10 to 14 business days. Not sure a part fits? Call {{ tel }}, 9am to 5pm EST, and we will confirm before you order.
  {%- when 'faq' -%}Will this part fit my Aiper?|Check the model in the part's name against your robot. If you are not sure which Scuba you own, call us and we will check.
  {%- endcase -%}

{%- when 'mowrator-accessories' -%}
  {%- case f -%}
  {%- when 'intro' -%}Batteries, chargers, blades, wheels, tires and kits for the Mowrator S1. Each part lists the S1 editions it fits, so you can check before you order.
  {%- when 'h2' -%}Finding the right part
  {%- when 'steps' -%}Check the edition. Some parts fit every S1; wheels, tires and the Snow Plow Kit depend on 2WD or 4WD. The fit is listed on each product page.
Blades. Choose self-sharpening, high-lift, self-sharpening high-lift or mulching blades, all sold in 3-packs.
Power. A spare 12Ah or 18Ah battery lets you swap and keep mowing, and the 600W charger refills it faster.
