  {%- when 'faq' -%}Will this part fit my S1?|Each part lists the editions it fits. If you are not sure which S1 you own, call us and we will check.
Does the Snow Plow Kit fit the 2WD?|No. Mowrator lists it for the S1 4WD only.
  {%- endcase -%}

{%- when 'wybot' -%}
