{%- when 'betta' -%}
  {%- case f -%}
  {%- when 'intro' -%}Betta solar robotic pool skimmers clear leaves, pollen and bugs from the surface around the clock, before they sink. Four models share the same solar skimming and differ in charging, control and the pools they suit.
  {%- when 'h2' -%}Which Betta?
  {%- when 'steps' -%}Charging. The SE and Flex run on solar only; the SE Plus and Neo add a wall adapter for cloudy stretches.
Control. The SE and SE Plus have a wireless remote, the Neo uses the Betta app and a 600 ft Gateway, and the Flex runs by itself.
Pool type. Only the Flex is rated for infinity edge pools. The SE Plus works in water as shallow as 3.5 inches.
  {%- when 'th' -%}You want|Betta
  {%- when 'table' -%}Simple solar skimming with a remote|SE
Backup charging and shallow-water handling|SE Plus
An infinity edge pool|Flex
App control and scheduling|Neo
  {%- when 'why' -%}We are an authorized Betta reseller. Free ground shipping within the contiguous US; Betta usually ships within 1 to 2 business days. Every Betta has a 1-year Betta warranty. Call {{ tel }}, 9am to 5pm EST.
  {%- when 'faq' -%}Can Betta run at night?|Yes. It cannot charge in the dark, but a full charge runs it for up to 30+ hours, per Betta.
Does Betta work in saltwater pools?|Yes, up to 5,000 ppm salt, per Betta.
  {%- endcase -%}

{%- when 'hobot' -%}
  {%- case f -%}
  {%- when 'intro' -%}HOBOT robots for the jobs inside the house: two window cleaning robots that hold to the glass with suction and spray as they clean, and the LEGEE-688, a floor robot that vacuums and mops hard floors in one pass.
  {%- when 'h2' -%}Which HOBOT?
  {%- when 'steps' -%}Windows or floors. The HOBOT-298 and HOBOT-2S clean glass on a planned route, tethered by a safety rope. The LEGEE-688 cleans hard floors.
Corners and frameless glass. HOBOT says the 2S reaches about 80% of each corner, and its Edge-Leakage Sensors track frameless edges.
Floors. The LEGEE-688 vacuums, dry mops, sprays and wet mops in one pass, with 7 cleaning modes including Kitchen and Pet.
  {%- when 'th' -%}You want|HOBOT
  {%- when 'table' -%}Standard framed windows|HOBOT-298
Frameless or large glass, deep corners|HOBOT-2S
Vacuum and mop hard floors|LEGEE-688
  {%- when 'why' -%}We are an authorized HOBOT dealer, and every HOBOT carries HOBOT's 1-year limited warranty. Pay over time with Shop Pay Installments, subject to an eligibility check. Questions go to our US team at {{ tel }}, 9am to 5pm EST.
  {%- when 'faq' -%}Which HOBOT is better for frameless glass?|The HOBOT-2S. Its Edge-Leakage Sensors detect the slight lift at the edge of frameless glass, and HOBOT says it reaches about 80% of each corner.
Does the LEGEE-688 vacuum and mop at the same time?|Yes. HOBOT designed it to vacuum, dry mop, spray and wet mop in one pass.
  {%- endcase -%}

